    "descriptionZh": "Storybook 插件开发套件（Storybook ADK）仓库，在 Storybook API 上封了一层中间件，用来简化 addon 注册、channel 数据同步和 addon UI 搭建。给要自己写 Storybook addon 的人用。",
    "takeawayZh": "用一套中间件把 addon 注册与状态同步包掉",
    "noteZh": "简报给的 storybookjs/addon-development-kit 会跳到 react-theming/addon-development-kit 这一页。About 写 Addon Development Kit for Storybook，topics 挂 addon、development、react、reactjs、storybook。README 开头先劝人改用 storybookjs/addon-kit，然后列 Simplifies the addons creation、Keeps in sync addon's data through the channel、Provides intelligent blocks for creating addon UI、Offer simple API for registering addons and creating decorators。Features 一节写它把 channel 通信和切 story 时的数据同步藏起来，并把 addon store 分成 global 与 local 两份。根目录 register.js、dev/、src/ 与 .storybook 并列，5 个 release、660 个下游使用者、125 Commits，MIT。",
